---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Features" description="Explore LaunchLegit's U.S. TikTok Shop setup, representative, banking, approval and support features.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container reveal"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Features</div><span class="section-kicker">Features</span><h1>The infrastructure behind your U.S. TikTok Shop launch.</h1><p class="lead">From the legal setup layer to platform submission and ongoing support, LaunchLegit brings the core workflow together.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">Get started</a></div></div></section>
<section><div class="container"><div class="grid-3">
<article class="card reveal"><div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><rect x="4" y="3" width="16" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M8 7h2M14 7h2M8 11h2M14 11h2M8 15h2M14 15h2M10 21v-3h4v3"/></svg></div><h3>LLC formation</h3><p class="muted">U.S. business formation as the foundation for the TikTok Shop setup.</p></article>
<article class="card reveal"><div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M3 10l9-6 9 6"/><path d="M5 10v9M9 10v9M15 10v9M19 10v9M3 19h18M2 22h20"/></svg></div><h3>EIN & banking assistance</h3><p class="muted">Support with obtaining the EIN and preparing the U.S. banking layer.</p></article>
<article class="card reveal"><div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-3 7.7-7 10-4-2.3-7-5.5-7-10V6l7-3z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></div><h3>U.S. representative</h3><p class="muted">A compliant U.S. business representative service aligned to the setup workflow.</p></article>
<article class="card reveal"><div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8 12l2.5 2.5L16 9"/></svg></div><h3>Platform approval handling</h3><p class="muted">Submission and approval support for the TikTok Shop USA process.</p></article>
<article class="card reveal"><div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M12 8a4 4 0 100 8 4 4 0 000-8z"/><path d="M4.9 4.9l2.2 2.2M16.9 16.9l2.2 2.2M4 12H1M23 12h-3M12 4V1M12 23v-3M4.9 19.1l2.2-2.2M16.9 7.1l2.2-2.2"/></svg></div><h3>Ongoing support</h3><p class="muted">Operational support and automations to keep the launch workflow organized.</p></article>
<article class="card reveal"><div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8 12l2.5 2.5L16 9"/></svg></div><h3>Creator & brand workflows</h3><p class="muted">Structured paths for e-commerce brands and creators pursuing affiliate or product sales.</p></article>
</div></div></section>
<section class="surface-alt"><div class="container cta-band reveal"><div><h2>Want to see which pieces apply to your business?</h2><p>We can walk through your current structure and the U.S. setup path.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/#calendly-section">Book a call</a></div></section>
<section class="eu-close"><div class="container split"><div class="reveal"><span class="section-kicker">European sellers</span><h2>Designed for international operating models.</h2></div><div class="reveal"><p class="lead">We keep the U.S. setup workflow distinct from your EU/UK obligations, use GDPR-conscious communication, and can coordinate across European time zones. VAT, tax and local compliance remain separate considerations to be handled with your relevant advisers.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">Plan your U.S. launch</a></div></div></section>
</Layout>
